          "tests/T010-32-wasm-embedding-js.sh",
          "tests/wasm/test-memory-reuse.mjs",
          "src/go/kame/lang/eval/provenance.go",
          "docs/ref-embedding.md"
        ],
        "review": false
      },
      "verify-suspended-declaration-registration": {
        "title": "Verify declaration registration across forwarded completions",
        "text": "When changing declaration work that can suspend on a forwarded host request, drive prepare, request, and completion separately. Check that suspension and failure leave no partial program installed. Count repeated requests during replay, and verify that an unsuccessful registration retains the observations needed for watch to recover.",
        "children": [],
        "sources": [
          "src/go/kame/host/wasm/request_test.go",
          "src/go/kame/host/wasm/declaration_discovery.go",
          "src/go/kame/host/wasm/build_sources.go",
          "plan-055.md"
        ],
        "review": false
      },
      "verify-terminal-handoff-before-cleanup": {
        "title": "Verify terminal handoff at the host boundary",
        "text": "For a native terminal handoff regression, synchronize on child startup and deferred-cleanup markers. Check the actual PTY foreground process group while the child is active and again while cleanup is held. Require the child to be reaped and the CLI foreground group restored before releasing cleanup. For the same configured command path on a host without handoff, require FEATURE_UNSUP with no process-started event or child side effect. Exercise configured argv through host serialization so losing terminalRequired cannot silently allow a spawn.",
        "children": [],
        "sources": [
          "src/go/kame/cmd/kame/repl_terminal_linux_test.go#TestNativeRecipeTerminalRestoresForegroundGroup",
